{% comment %}Approved industry-story homepage. Original homepage remains available through index.original.json.{% endcomment %}
{% for block in section.blocks %}
{% assign signup_instance = section.id | append: '-' | append: block.id %}
{% case block.type %}
{% when 'hero' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--hero" id="story-intro" aria-labelledby="story-intro-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<p class="story-kicker">Whole-food satiety</p>
<h1 class="story-heading story-heading--hero" id="story-intro-title">{% if block.settings.headline == 'Satiety is the starting point.' %}<span class="story-hero-line">Satiety is the</span> <span class="story-hero-line">starting point.</span>{% else %}{{ block.settings.headline | escape }}{% endif %}</h1>
<div class="story-copy story-hero__intro">{{ block.settings.intro }}</div>
<a class="story-text-link story-hero-use" href="#routine">See how to use INCHY</a>
{% render 'inchy-story-signup', instance_id: signup_instance %}
<p class="story-note">{{ block.settings.note | escape }}</p>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'pouch' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--pouch" id="product" aria-labelledby="product-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<div class="story-product-grid">
<figure class="story-product-visual story-product-visual--seed">
{% render 'inchy-packaging', image_class: 'story-packaging', loading: 'eager' %}
<img class="story-product-pod" src="{{ 'inchy-single-pod.webp' | asset_url }}" width="640" height="640" loading="lazy" alt="A star-shaped sacha inchi pod, the source of INCHY">
</figure>
<div class="story-product-copy" id="shop-inchy">
<p class="story-kicker">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</p>
<h2 class="story-heading" id="product-title"><span>One seed.</span><span>Made for your food.</span></h2>
<p class="story-pouch-position">Whole-food satiety</p>
<div class="story-copy">{{ block.settings.copy }}</div>
<ul class="story-product-facts" aria-label="Ingredients at a glance"><li>One ingredient</li><li>No sweeteners</li><li>No added flavours</li></ul>
{% capture story_product_url %}{% render 'inchy-shop-url' %}{% endcapture %}
{% assign story_product_url = story_product_url | strip %}
{% if story_product_url contains '#shop-inchy' %}{% assign story_product_url = '#process' %}{% endif %}
<a class="story-text-link" href="{{ story_product_url | strip | escape }}">Explore INCHY</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'founder' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--founder" aria-label="A conviction" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container"><figure class="story-founder-bet"><blockquote><p><span class="story-founder-bet__premise">Everyone’s betting the answer to appetite is an injection.</span><span class="story-founder-bet__answer">We’re betting it’s a seed.</span></p></blockquote></figure></div>
</section>
{% when 'problem' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--problem" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<p class="story-kicker">Common problem</p>
<div class="story-split"><h2 class="story-heading" id="approach-title"><span>Dinner ends.</span><span>The wanting doesn't.</span></h2>
<div class="story-copy">
<p>10pm. Dinner was hours ago and you’re back in the kitchen. One biscuit becomes three. You’re not necessarily hungry enough for another meal. But food is back in the conversation.</p>
<p>If that sounds familiar, you understand why INCHY exists.</p>
</div></div>
<hr class="story-divider">
<p class="story-kicker">Our approach</p>
<div class="story-split"><div><h3 class="story-heading story-approach-heading">Put satiety first.</h3></div><div class="story-copy"><p>Satiety is what happens after eating — how satisfied you remain and how long the meal carries you.</p><p>Protein and fibre explain our formulation. Satiety explains why we developed it.</p><p>A non-pharmaceutical approach, built from food.</p></div></div>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'refusal' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--refusal" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<p class="story-kicker">The formulation</p>
<h2 class="story-heading" id="process-title"><span>What's in the pouch: sacha inchi.</span><span>What isn't: everything else.</span></h2>
<div class="story-formulation-grid">
<figure class="story-formulation-visual">
<img class="story-formulation-pouch" src="{{ 'inchy-reference-pouch.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="928" height="1152" loading="lazy" alt="INCHY sacha inchi pouch">
<img class="story-formulation-pod" src="{{ 'inchy-single-pod.webp' | asset_url }}" width="640" height="640" loading="lazy" alt="A single mature sacha inchi pod resting beside the pouch">
</figure>
<div class="story-refusal story-copy">
<p><strong>The invention is what the seed becomes.</strong></p>
<p>Keeping the seed’s protein and fibre together was one challenge. Making that combination work in everyday food was the other.</p>
<p>We developed INCHY around taste, texture and mixing. Our process transforms sacha inchi into a powder made for food you already eat, with no added flavours to cover it up.</p>
<p>The method stays ours; the difference belongs in your bowl.</p>
<p><strong>The easy versions existed.</strong><br>Isolate the protein. Strip the fibre. Cover the taste with vanilla and sweetener.</p>
<p><strong>We refused all of it.</strong></p>
<p class="story-formulation-facts">NO SWEETENERS · NO FLAVOURS<br>NO GUMS · NO EMULSIFIERS</p>
<a class="story-text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=process">Explore our process</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'belief' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--belief" aria-labelledby="belief-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<p class="story-kicker">What we believe</p>
<h2 class="story-heading story-belief" id="belief-title"><span>We are not trying to make a supplement behave more like food.</span><span>We are trying to prove how powerfully food can behave when you stop pulling it apart.</span></h2>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'industry' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--industry" id="origin" aria-labelledby="origin-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<p class="story-kicker">Our origin</p>
<h2 class="story-heading" id="origin-title"><span>The growers aren't</span><span>a footnote.</span></h2>
<div class="story-industry-grid"><div class="story-copy">{{ block.settings.copy }}</div><figure class="story-grower"><img src="{{ 'inchy-growers-harvest.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1280" height="854" alt="Emilio holding harvested sacha inchi fruit in the field" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Emilio · ASIN grower · Santander, Colombia.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="story-origin-facts">
<div><h3>What is ASIN?</h3><p>The Asociación de Sachaincheros del Nororiente Colombiano: the Association of Sacha Inchi Farmers of Northeastern Colombia.</p></div>
<div><h3>Why did we help form it?</h3><p>To put growers at the centre of sourcing premium sacha inchi, and work together on the quality our product needs.</p></div>
<div><h3>What happens before planting?</h3><p>We discuss cultivation standards, prices and purchasing commitments before seed goes into the ground.</p></div>
<div><h3>What does that mean for INCHY?</h3><p>A known source and a shared quality standard for the sacha inchi we use to make INCHY.</p></div>
</div>
<p class="story-industry__statement">If it doesn't work for the people who grow it, it doesn't work as a business.</p>
{% comment %}Future verified metric: families under signed contract. Add only after contracts are signed; never show an estimated or placeholder count.{% endcomment %}
</div>
</section>
{% when 'research' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--research" id="research" aria-labelledby="research-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<p class="story-kicker">The research</p>
<h2 class="story-heading" id="research-title"><span>What the research shows.</span></h2>
<div class="story-research-grid">
<div class="story-research-item">
<p class="story-kicker">Nutrient research</p>
<h3>Protein + fibre</h3>
<p>Protein and certain dietary fibres can stimulate the body's own release of GLP-1 — a gut hormone involved in appetite regulation.</p>
<p class="story-evidence-limit">These are findings about particular nutrients and study preparations. They do not establish the GLP-1 response to a serving of INCHY.</p>
<a class="story-text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=research#protein">Protein + fibre evidence</a>
</div>
<div class="story-research-item">
<p class="story-kicker">Laboratory research</p>
<h3>Sacha inchi peptides</h3>
<details class="story-lab-detail"><summary>Read the laboratory findings</summary>
<p>Laboratory research on sacha inchi protein hydrolysates has identified peptides with DPP-IV (DPP-4) inhibitory activity. (Zhang et al., 2023.)</p></details>
<p class="story-evidence-limit">This was laboratory research. It was not a human trial of finished INCHY and does not establish effects on appetite, DPP-IV or GLP-1 in people.</p>
<a class="story-text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=research">Explore the evidence</a>
</div>
</div>
<p class="story-copy story-research-close"><em>We want the evidence badly.<br>Just not badly enough to invent it.</em></p>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'routine' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--routine" id="routine" aria-labelledby="routine-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container">
<p class="story-kicker">The routine</p>
<h2 class="story-heading" id="routine-title"><span>Food first.</span><span>INCHY fits around it.</span></h2>
{% if block.settings.preparation_video != blank %}
<div class="story-preparation-video">{{ block.settings.preparation_video | video_tag: controls: true, preload: 'metadata', playsinline: true }}</div>
{% else %}
<div class="story-routine-grid">{% for step in (1..3) %}<figure class="story-routine-step story-routine-step--{{ step }}"><div class="story-routine-photo"><img src="{{ 'inchy-routine.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1942" height="809" loading="lazy" alt="{% case step %}{% when 1 %}Powder added to yoghurt{% when 2 %}Powder added to oats{% when 3 %}Powder stirred into a drink{% endcase %}"></div><figcaption><span>0{{ step }}</span>{% case step %}{% when 1 %}In yoghurt{% when 2 %}In oats{% when 3 %}In a drink{% endcase %}</figcaption></figure>{% endfor %}</div>
{% endif %}
<div class="story-routine-instructions story-copy">
<h3>Start with a bowl you already make.</h3>
<p>Measure the serving stated on your pouch, stir thoroughly into yoghurt or oats, and make it part of your usual meal.</p>
<p class="story-taste-note">Unflavoured means no added flavour. The seed still has its own taste and texture; what you mix it into makes a difference.</p>
</div>
<a class="story-text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=how-to-use">Preparation &amp; serving guidance</a>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'faq' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container story-faq-grid">
<h2 class="story-heading" id="faq-title"><span>Questions, answered</span><span>straight.</span></h2>
<div class="story-faq">
{% render 'inchy-story-faq', association_answer: block.settings.association_answer %}
</div>
</div>
</section>
{% when 'launch' %}
<section class="story-section story-section--close" id="first-access" aria-labelledby="first-access-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="story-container story-close-grid">
<div><p class="story-kicker">Whole-food satiety</p><h2 class="story-heading" id="first-access-title">Put satiety first.</h2><p class="story-close__tagline">A non-pharmaceutical approach built from one remarkable seed.</p></div>
<div>
{% render 'inchy-story-signup', instance_id: signup_instance %}
<p class="story-note">U.S. launch coming soon. Join the list for launch news and an email when ordering opens.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
{% endcase %}
{% endfor %}
{% schema %}
